		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>２０[Digit:2digits Idx="0" ]ねん[Digit:2digits Idx="1" ]がつ[Digit:2digits Idx="2" ]にち
[System:Color name="2" ][Name:Place Idx="4" ][/System:Color]で
